352
00:15:45.744 --> 00:15:48.714
the model are hot dog or not a hot dog.

353
00:15:48.981 --> 00:15:50.115
To help you get started,

354
00:15:50.115 --> 00:15:51.583
we're also including some code

355
00:15:51.583 --> 00:15:53.419
that will iterate
through the images in a file

356
00:15:53.419 --> 00:15:55.688
and run our model on them
to see how well it does.

357
00:15:55.688 --> 00:15:57.990
Let's
go see how well this does unstructured.

358
00:15:58.958 --> 00:16:00.526
Let's
take a look at how well the model did.

359
00:16:00.526 --> 00:16:03.529
As you can see, it correctly
