361
00:16:06.699 --> 00:16:10.002
We wanted it to produce
hot dog lowercase with no period.

362
00:16:10.169 --> 00:16:12.471
Now, this might seem
like a bit of a nitpick,

363
00:16:12.471 --> 00:16:16.442
but if you're building a production
classification system

364
00:16:16.442 --> 00:16:20.145
for hot dog or not hot dog, you absolutely
