365
00:16:20.279 --> 00:16:23.248
We can quickly scroll
through the other results and see that

366
00:16:23.248 --> 00:16:27.119
we have similar problems across the board
correctly labeled not a hot dog didn't

367
00:16:27.119 --> 00:16:30.356
adhere to our guidelines,
but when we get to this last image here,

368
00:16:30.389 --> 00:16:32.324
we can see
the model really went off the rails.

369
00:16:32.324 --> 00:16:35.327
It just describes this
as this airplane is flying in the sky.

370
00:16:35.327 --> 00:16:37.229
Well, a correct description of the image.

371
00:16:37.229 --> 00:16:38.464
This isn't what we wanted.

372
00:16:38.464 --> 00:16:42.234
Your task is to take what we learned in
